# Ship the app in three places

Any files the task needs may be changed. Do not stop after editing source alone.

Before an app change is done, the same change must be in all three places:

1. **`web/`** — the console source. Change other repo files too when the task needs them.
2. **`dist/ROC-Panels`** — the packaged pedestal app (`ROC-Panels.exe`). Rebuild it with `packaging/Build-Pedestal.ps1` so this copy matches the source. `dist/` is gitignored; it is the local app, not something to commit. If the running app locks that folder, close it and continue.
3. **GitHub** — commit the source, push it, and merge it into the default branch.

Leave all three current together. A change that exists only in the working tree, only in `web/`, or only in `dist/ROC-Panels` is not finished.
